### AIDS

* **Background:** First discovered in `America in 1981`, AIDS (**Acquired Immune Deficiency Syndrome**) is recognized worldwide, with a ++high concentration++ of cases in `Africa`.
  +++ see the map
  ![diagram](https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/World_map_of_HIV_prevalence%2C_2023.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=original)
  +++
  <br>
* **Cause:** It is caused by the **Human Immunodeficiency Virus** (HIV).
* **Mechanism:** The human immune system relies on **lymphocytes** in the blood to produce antibodies. HIV **targets and destroys** `T-lymphocytes` (white blood cells), weakening body immunity and leaving the individual vulnerable to fatal opportunistic infections.
